":2722479600,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6iRb3w","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-13T19:28:55Z","updated_at":"2025-03-13T19:29:45Z","body":"> We seem to have initialize_theme_noproject() which may be intended for similar use cases, would you check if that one can also solve the problem?\r\n\r\nIt should work.\r\n\r\nAnd we also need to import custom font or there later, if `gui/theme/custom_font`/`gui/theme/custom` are set.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2722479600/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2722485892","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104081#issuecomment-2722485892","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104081","id":2722485892,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6iRdaE","user":{"login":"pewcworrell","id":101294411,"node_id":"U_kgDOBgmhSw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/101294411?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell","html_url":"https://github.com/pewcworrell","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-13T19:31:55Z","updated_at":"2025-03-13T19:32:51Z","body":"> > We seem to have initialize_theme_noproject() which may be intended for similar use cases, would you check if that one can also solve the problem?\r\n> \r\n> It should work.\r\n> \r\n> And we also need to import custom font later, if `gui/theme/custom_font` is set.\r\n\r\nTo clarify a few things here:\r\n1. Is custom font needed if we're strictly importing?\r\n2. When exactly is \"later\"?\r\n3. If we can import the custom font later, perhaps we should do that in all cases instead of just when strictly importing?\r\n\r\nThis comment gives me some pause, because I don't fully understand it:\r\n```\r\n#if defined(MODULE_MONO_ENABLED) && defined(TOOLS_ENABLED)\r\n\t// Hacky to have it here, but we don't have good facility yet to let modules\r\n\t// register command line options to call at the right time. This needs to happen\r\n\t// after init'ing the ScriptServer, but also after init'ing the ThemeDB,\r\n\t// for the C# docs generation in the bindings.\r\n```","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/re